{"candidate_identity":"20b3708664c696f86fe2bb852d68afc4372416c02445dd6beca5157d4e94388c","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"417e0a016f2e694679008b81fc97e47a128ce54f1a186961918343d084aec033","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0d1faf01e017cafc79782bc60d75f8b267ad36fe618f7f57cd08b381af9326bf","logical_entry_identity":"93fd5b05dd362d8a8804b5b9f88c6b7d6eb261a5a86b38daa410ed7936a8e8c0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A figure squats in the darkness with his face turned your way. At first you're not sure if Kyless recognizes you.\nHis face seems twisted by hunger and madness. But soon it softens and he begins to look more like the Kyless of old.\nHe speaks your name in recognition but doesn't move. Slowly, almost imperceptibly, the air in the room begins to change.\nA charge seems to fill the space around you. Small gusts of wind pick up and scatter dust across the floor.\nYou feel as if the room itself is coming to bear upon you. Kyless smiles and then attacks.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"黑暗中蹲伏着一个面朝你的人。一开始，你无法确认克里斯是否认出了你。\n他的面容仿佛因饥饿与疯狂而扭曲。但很快，他的神情缓和下来，渐渐恢复了昔日的模样。\n他一动不动，叫出了你的名字。慢慢地，你发觉这个空间里的空气发生了几不可察的变化。\n你感到四周仿佛充满了某种能量。阵阵微风吹起，卷散了地面上的尘土。\n你感到整个空间似乎都压向了你。克里斯嘴角扬起一抹微笑，向你发起了攻击……\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0d9a8d29a2a2bf6d33414ee86ae63284c452f4230aebf5b287e85d8438f3679d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0d22dc71efd1de9170f0ce8f4bb23a5a92033400086c6be08862a61a010007da","logical_entry_identity":"dbaf818b5376c9d180367d6b036bfd74db0d5d87bdf5c85ec207b017d5c24f28","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This is not my problem. Go away!","source_tag":"_t","target":"和我没关系，闪开！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6fe09138b3c9d5e6764622f71c74c8477a5480564688d52e0f688aa4a71be6c3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0d288f608bebdee988682bf75153f15fb685a93b637e68d73a24646f3d30beaa","logical_entry_identity":"774861ee75c5701ad404a38b192fe6ff8d499b43974267a9324f651ca